					</summary>
					<div class="p-5 pt-0 text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
						In rare cases where Batch Export is interrupted, the On-Screen Info (HUD) watermark overlay might remain in the viewport. To clear it: click the "Clear HUD" button in the Shadow Analysis panel or toggle the tool again.
						<div class="mt-3 flex items-center justify-center">
