				<details class="group bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-sm">
					<summary class="flex items-center justify-between p-5 font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white hover:text-amber-500 transition-colors select-none">
						<span>Can I turn off or hide the Sun Path diagram while keeping building shadows?</span>
						<svg class="w-5 h-5 text-slate-400 transition-transform duration-300 accordion-chevron flex-shrink-0 ml-2" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"/></svg>
					</summary>
					<div class="p-5 pt-0 text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
						Yes, absolutely! The Sun Path diagram generated by the extension is assigned to dedicated tags (e.g. <code>Feb_SunPath</code>, <code>Feb_Dome</code>). Simply toggle those tags off in SketchUp’s Tags panel; your building shadows will remain 100% active.
					</div>
				</details>

				<details class="group bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-sm">
					<summary class="flex items-center justify-between p-5 font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white hover:text-amber-500 transition-colors select-none">
						<span>The Sun Path diagram geometry is casting shadows on my building. How do I disable that?</span>
						<svg class="w-5 h-5 text-slate-400 transition-transform duration-300 accordion-chevron flex-shrink-0 ml-2" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"/></svg>
					</summary>
					<div class="p-5 pt-0 text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
						Select the Sun Path group, open <strong>Entity Info</strong>, and uncheck <strong>"Cast Shadows"</strong>.
					</div>
				</details>

				<details class="group bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-sm">
					<summary class="flex items-center justify-between p-5 font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white hover:text-amber-500 transition-colors select-none">
